  "title": "The Advantages of Lightweight Concrete Masonry Units (LWT CMU)",
  "summary": "High-performing lightweight aggregates (LWAs) like expanded shales and clays are key ingredients in producing excellent lightweight concrete masonry units (LWT CMU). A typical LWT CMU weighs 30-40 percent less than normal weight (NWT) CMU and meets all the requirements of ASTM C90 (Standard Specification for Loadbearing Concrete Masonry Units).",
